    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "10:41 AM",
      "text": "I was just reading your tweet about players missing from workouts. Do you think we will make it to the actual season?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:42 AM",
      "text": "I really don’t know"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "10:44 AM",
      "text": "https://www.instagram.com/p/CB1Xcm7FI6s/"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "10:44 AM",
      "text": "you ever have him as a prof?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:45 AM",
      "text": "Yeah and he was great"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "10:48 AM",
      "text": "I didn’t see the video referenced, but it sounds like he was quoting? Maybe not the best move, but I can’t see it being ill-intentioned"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:16 AM",
      "text": "I agree"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:16 AM",
      "text": "Sounds like he gave someone a bad grade"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "11:17 AM",
      "text": "I realized I clicked on your profile to read the players tweet and realized I got that link from your profile when I thought I was on the home page lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:17 AM",
      "text": "Yeah someone I worked with tweeted that"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:17 AM",
      "text": "And since he’s black it was easy"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:17 AM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:18 AM",
      "text": "So I RT it"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "11:18 AM",
      "text": "Haha I realize that now. I’m having a slow morning, apparently"
    }
  ]
